WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.850
Open your laptop. A Google Meet conversation is already underway.

00:04.850 --> 00:07.200
Open Trapping Rain Water. Keep Google Meet in a small floating window.

00:07.200 --> 00:10.000
Find Cue in Spotlight and open it over your workspace.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
Switch to incognito. The dotted border marks your local protected view.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
Use Smart assist with screen context for a two-pointer solution.

00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
Screen + mic + interviewer. The context comes together.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.500
A clear solution. Right on cue. Linear time, constant extra space.

00:26.500 --> 00:29.300
Your mode. Your context. Capture behavior varies by app and platform.

00:29.300 --> 00:31.000
Stay in the conversation. The right words. Right on cue.

